{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^Jsem Eliška, učenka z Fereldenu. Zkoumám stopy nad průsmykem. ","#","^reveal:name","/#","\n","^O kurýrovi píšou všichni jinak. Já měřím skály. ","#","^cut","/#","\n","ev","str","^Kronika tvrdí, že to byl blesk.","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^A co ti pašeráci s olejem?","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Blesk nezlomí pečeť smlouvy.","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-2","flg":20},"ev","str","^Nemám čas na akademické hádky – vražda, nebo ne?","/str",{"VAR?":"stress"},3,">=",{"VAR?":"aff_k3"},0,">=","&&","/ev",{"*":"0.c-3","flg":21},{"c-0":["\n","^Stopa po blesku je čerstvá – to ano. ","#","^reveal:faction ","/#","#","^aff:self:+2 ","/#","#","^aff:k3:+2 ","/#","#","^stress:-1","/#","\n",{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Pašeráci jsou výhodný příběh pro Nilfgaard. ","#","^aff:k2:-2 ","/#","#","^aff:k3:+1 ","/#","#","^aff:self:+1 ","/#","#","^stress:+1","/#","\n",{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","^…To je pravda. Pečeť zlomil člověk. ","#","^aff:self:-1 ","/#","#","^aff:k1:+1 ","/#","#","^aff:k2:+1 ","/#","#","^cut ","/#","#","^stress:+2","/#","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"believes_murder","re":true},{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-3":["\n","^Vražda. Ano. Teď už to řeknu nahlas. ","#","^aff:self:+1 ","/#","#","^aff:k3:+1 ","/#","#","^stress:+2 ","/#","#","^cut","/#","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"believes_murder","re":true},{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"g-0":["^Půjdu zítra nahoru měřit znovu – jestli mě vojáci pustí.","\n","ev","str","^Ferelden chce klid. To je správně.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-4","flg":20},"ev","str","^Redanie má svědky.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-5","flg":20},"ev","str","^Nilfgaard popírá všechno.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-6","flg":20},"ev","str","^Vaše měření může zachránit průsmyk.","/str",{"VAR?":"aff_self"},2,">=",{"VAR?":"stress"},4,"<","&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-7","flg":21},{"c-4":["\n","^Ano. Válka spálí i moje poznámky. ","#","^reveal:faction ","/#","#","^aff:self:+2 ","/#","#","^aff:k3:+2 ","/#","#","^